82
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,799
But to place first

83
00:11:47,519 --> 00:11:49,159
in the provincial examination

84
00:11:49,559 --> 00:11:51,679
is a distinction granted
to one in ten thousand.

85
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:53,720
Exactly. One in ten thousand.

86
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,759
Clearly, placing first in
the examination is the greater occasion.

87
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,720
Sir, we'd appreciate your help.

88
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:03,960
Please make way.

89
00:12:04,519 --> 00:12:07,000
- Please make way, Sir.
- Please make way, Sir.

90
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:10,200
What's going on?

91
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:16,550
The provincial examination was postponed
after the late Emperor's death.

92
00:12:16,550 --> 00:12:18,040
The results were only released today.

93
00:12:18,264 --> 00:12:20,840
We deliberately avoided
the area around the Confucius Temple,

94
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:23,320
but despite all our planning,

95
00:12:23,799 --> 00:12:25,360
