97
00:12:29,896 --> 00:12:31,864
The top provincial graduate,
Scholar Han?

98
00:12:32,919 --> 00:12:34,000
Yes, Scholar Han...

99
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:39,399
What are we going to do?

100
00:12:39,679 --> 00:12:42,000
They're both major occasions.
Who should give way to whom?

101
00:13:01,559 --> 00:13:04,200
- Please make way, Sir.
- Please make way, Sir.

102
00:13:13,170 --> 00:13:14,568
We need to handle this carefully.

103
00:13:14,584 --> 00:13:16,750
Placing first in Jiangnan
is no ordinary distinction.

104
00:13:16,759 --> 00:13:18,360
He may well become a Hanlin bachelor

105
00:13:18,408 --> 00:13:20,264
