enter the Grand Secretariat.

106
00:13:21,559 --> 00:13:22,799
It's all your fault.

107
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:25,352
If you had worked harder
and passed the examination,

108
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,720
