the examination hall to see the results.

109
00:13:27,759 --> 00:13:30,759
Then we'd know
who placed first and where he lives.

110
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,600
How... how is this my fault?

111
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,056
Of course it's your fault.

112
00:13:45,816 --> 00:13:46,840
Lanxiang, don't worry.

113
00:13:46,888 --> 00:13:49,800
We've run into a procession bringing
news to the top provincial graduate.

114
00:13:50,039 --> 00:13:53,000
I hear his name is Han Liang,

115
00:13:53,064 --> 00:13:54,200
and he lives nearby, too.

116
00:13:54,200 --> 00:13:55,559
You could say you're neighbors.

117
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,639
Don't worry.

118
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,519
Don't be afraid, Lanxiang.

119
00:13:58,639 --> 00:14:01,200
I'm really good with my slingshot now.

120
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:03,679
I won't let them disturb you.

121
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:12,440
The top provincial graduate,
Scholar Han, is here!

122
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,000
Han.

123
00:14:17,039 --> 00:14:17,600
Thank you.

124
00:14:17,600 --> 00:14:18,360
Scholar Han.

125
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,159
Thank you.

126
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,039
Scholar Han.

127
00:14:20,519 --> 00:14:21,080
Thank you.

128
00:14:21,519 --> 00:14:22,080
Thank you.

129
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:36,960
He's so young.

130
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:40,039
He doesn't look bookish at all.

131
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:41,919
He has a promising future ahead of him.

132
00:14:42,159 --> 00:14:44,759
We mustn't offend him. We mustn't.

133
00:14:45,960 --> 00:14:47,240
I already have.

134
00:14:54,680 --> 00:14:57,800
Congratulations on placing first in
the provincial examination, Scholar Han.

135
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,200
