149
00:15:46,840 --> 00:15:48,600
Had I not been truly sincere,

150
00:15:48,744 --> 00:15:51,528
I could never have obtained
the Emperor's decree for this marriage.

151
00:15:52,639 --> 00:15:53,919
So I hope, Scholar Han,

152
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:57,000
