the sincerity of my devotion

153
00:15:59,679 --> 00:16:01,279
and help another man fulfill his wish.

154
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:11,780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

155
00:16:11,780 --> 00:16:14,860
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

156
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,740
