180
00:17:25,350 --> 00:17:26,520
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

181
00:17:27,224 --> 00:17:28,690
- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!

182
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:38,860
♪From this endless dream,
