00:20:51,240 --> 00:20:52,840
Let's have some fun with the newlyweds!

219
00:20:52,888 --> 00:20:54,350
Have some fun with the newlyweds!

220
00:20:54,359 --> 00:20:56,160
- Good!
- Good!

