267
00:25:05,464 --> 00:25:07,368
before discussing marriage with you.

268
00:25:09,279 --> 00:25:10,400
I was at fault.

269
00:25:13,759 --> 00:25:15,039
Please forgive me, my lady.

270
00:25:32,660 --> 00:25:35,220
♪The golden sunset♪

271
00:25:35,220 --> 00:25:38,700
♪Sketches my thoughts♪

272
00:25:40,540 --> 00:25:43,060
♪All things fall silent♪

273
00:25:43,060 --> 00:25:46,420
♪Fearing to disturb this moment♪

274
00:25:47,100 --> 00:25:50,260
♪My restless heart
seeks a place to anchor♪

275
00:25:50,260 --> 00:25:53,780
♪Yet I cannot stop searching♪

276
00:25:54,540 --> 00:26:00,180
♪I wonder if the past
has ever been heard♪

277
00:26:02,940 --> 00:26:06,380
♪Yesterday's brush and ink♪

278
00:26:06,380 --> 00:26:09,780
♪Lightly traced cause and effect♪

279
00:26:09,780 --> 00:26:10,820
(Lin)

280
00:26:10,820 --> 00:26:13,260
♪Half a lifetime of longing♪

281
00:26:13,260 --> 00:26:16,580
♪Returns to this moment♪

282
00:26:18,359 --> 00:26:19,519
If you're hungry...

283
00:26:20,900 --> 00:26:24,260
♪If the image isn't real,
what does it matter?♪

284
00:26:24,980 --> 00:26:30,300
♪I still remember your name♪

285
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,839
Yuchan, Gantang, and the others

286
00:26:43,319 --> 00:26:44,519
are waiting outside.

287
00:26:46,079 --> 00:26:47,160
Whatever you want to eat

288
00:26:47,759 --> 00:26:48,680
or need,

289
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:50,400
just tell them anytime.

290
00:26:54,119 --> 00:26:55,599
This is your home now.

291
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:59,200
Make yourself comfortable.

292
00:27:02,860 --> 00:27:05,100
♪I no longer blame the moon♪

293
00:27:05,100 --> 00:27:10,060
♪For withholding its light♪

294
00:27:10,460 --> 00:27:13,780
♪I only pray that those I've known♪

295
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,079
I'll go outside

296
00:27:15,720 --> 00:27:16,799
and see to the guests.

297
00:27:18,424 --> 00:27:19,830
I'll be back a little later.

298
00:27:22,260 --> 00:27:24,820
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

299
00:27:25,540 --> 00:27:29,580
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

300
00:27:29,580 --> 00:27:35,620
♪You and I will walk there together♪

301
00:27:58,232 --> 00:27:59,590
(Cry as hard as you can.)

302
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,000
(Let it all out.)

303
00:28:03,768 --> 00:28:05,830
(Once we're done crying,
let's live our lives well.)

304
00:28:05,839 --> 00:28:08,820
♪Returns to this moment♪

305
00:28:09,759 --> 00:28:10,839
Live with all your might.

306
00:28:13,192 --> 00:28:14,240
Live as hard as you can.

307
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:17,759
Live like wild grass,

308
00:28:20,799 --> 00:28:22,240
without a care in the world.

309
00:28:25,160 --> 00:28:26,599
From now on,

310
00:28:28,808 --> 00:28:30,310
(our days will know only spring,)

311
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,440
(never winter.)

312
00:28:37,279 --> 00:28:39,039
(Let's live on without a care.)

313
00:28:39,340 --> 00:28:43,740
♪No longer let the world's
wind and snow fall♪

314
00:28:43,740 --> 00:28:46,700
♪And leave the grass
and trees covered in frost♪

315
00:28:46,700 --> 00:28:50,580
♪I only wish that
where the lights grow dim♪

316
00:28:50,580 --> 00:28:54,620
♪You and I will walk there together♪

317
00:28:54,620 --> 00:28:57,860
♪I no longer search through old dreams♪

318
00:28:57,860 --> 00:29:00,940
♪Leaving them buried deep
within the years♪

319
00:29:02,020 --> 00:29:05,540
♪I only long to journey
through the night together♪

320
00:29:05,540 --> 00:29:09,140
♪Toward where my heart leads♪

321
00:29:09,820 --> 00:29:13,940
♪I no longer lament
that fate is hard to foresee♪

322
00:29:13,940 --> 00:29:17,060
♪Accepting the unexpected as ordinary♪

323
00:29:17,420 --> 00:29:21,020
♪I only wish the road
behind us would fade like mist♪

324
00:29:21,020 --> 00:29:26,700
♪And we would share the road home♪

325
00:29:40,519 --> 00:29:41,279
Good for her!

326
00:29:42,839 --> 00:29:43,839
He deserved it.

327
00:29:45,240 --> 00:29:46,759
That wretched boy deserved it.

328
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:51,000
Is everything you just said true?

329
00:29:51,350 --> 00:29:52,456
Young Madam had no idea

330
00:29:52,488 --> 00:29:54,080
that Young Master wanted to marry her?

331
00:29:55,079 --> 00:29:56,119
If you don't believe me,

332
00:29:56,799 --> 00:29:57,720
you can send someone

333
00:29:57,920 --> 00:29:59,768
to ask Madam Tao,
the official matchmaker.

334
00:30:00,240 --> 00:30:01,240
Uncle Xu and Aunt Xu

335
00:30:02,200 --> 00:30:03,319
almost arranged her marriage

336
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:05,319
to the Han family next door.

337
00:30:09,839 --> 00:30:12,000
Young Madam
certainly has a fierce temper.

338
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:15,350
Even if Young Master forced her
into this marriage,

339
00:30:15,680 --> 00:30:17,480
a bride still shouldn't hit her groom.

340
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:20,480
That wretched boy
went looking for a beating.

341
00:30:22,390 --> 00:30:23,656
He even went to all that trouble

342
00:30:23,660 --> 00:30:25,880
to obtain an imperial decree
just to get himself beaten.

343
00:30:26,480 --> 00:30:27,480
He deserved it.

344
00:30:29,656 --> 00:30:30,872
You! This is all your fault!

345
00:30:30,904 --> 00:30:32,750
You didn't try
to talk Young Master out of it!

346
00:30:32,759 --> 00:30:34,000
Mother, be reasonable!

347
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:35,240
Please be reasonable!

348
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:35,880
Young...

349
00:30:36,440 --> 00:30:38,559
Is Young Master
someone who listens to advice?

350
00:30:38,600 --> 00:30:40,888
Even so, you should've
tried to talk him out of it!

351
00:30:41,799 --> 00:30:42,720
Enough.

352
00:30:43,272 --> 00:30:45,144
Jiugao isn't the one
who deserves a beating.

353
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,000
Get out of here.

354
00:30:58,680 --> 00:30:59,830
Go back to the banquet

355
00:31:00,392 --> 00:31:01,510
and attend to the guests.

356
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:05,799
So we're just letting this go?

357
00:31:06,599 --> 00:31:07,720
If we don't,

358
00:31:08,500 --> 00:31:10,030
am I supposed to help that wretched boy

359
00:31:10,039 --> 00:31:11,359
by slapping the bride?

360
00:31:12,536 --> 00:31:14,000
Haven't we made enough of a spectacle

361
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,079
of the Lin family already?

362
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:18,680
With that wretched boy around,

363
00:31:18,856 --> 00:31:19,800
I think Jinling City

364
00:31:19,810 --> 00:31:22,376
will have enough to laugh about
for the next three to five years.

365
00:31:25,599 --> 00:31:27,319
First Madam, it's a joyous occasion.

366
00:31:27,319 --> 00:31:28,920
You can't hit him anymore. You can't!

367
00:31:30,000 --> 00:31:31,359
I'm not hitting my son.

368
00:31:31,390 --> 00:31:32,400
Surely you don't expect me

369
00:31:32,400 --> 00:31:34,490
to greet the guests
with a feather duster in my hand?

370
00:31:35,680 --> 00:31:37,000
I'm getting senile.

371
00:31:44,759 --> 00:31:46,039
That rotten boy.

372
00:31:46,599 --> 00:31:47,759
He's been the only one happy

373
00:31:47,759 --> 00:31:49,839
about this marriage
from beginning to end,

374
00:31:50,559 --> 00:31:51,359
yet he insists

375
00:31:51,359 --> 00:31:53,240
that all of us smile along with him.

376
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:55,759
First Madam,
you're worrying too much.

377
00:31:56,559 --> 00:31:59,200
There are people who are
genuinely happy for Young Master.

378
00:31:59,496 --> 00:32:00,920
Of course they're genuinely happy

379
00:32:00,984 --> 00:32:02,550
when there's a spectacle to enjoy.

380
00:32:09,839 --> 00:32:11,240
Come. A toast to everyone.

381
00:32:13,680 --> 00:32:14,680
Congratulations!

382
00:32:14,799 --> 00:32:15,740
What took you so long?

383
00:32:15,750 --> 00:32:16,728
Eat and drink your fill.

384
00:32:21,960 --> 00:32:22,720
Good liquor.

385
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:27,510
See to the guests.

386
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:29,030
Eat and drink your fill!

387
00:32:29,359 --> 00:32:30,680
Come, eat and drink your fill.

388
00:32:36,039 --> 00:32:36,960
Let me take a look.

389
00:32:38,039 --> 00:32:39,119
Did she break the skin?

390
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:42,079
Want me to rub it for you?

391
00:32:44,519 --> 00:32:45,400
You only know

392
00:32:45,839 --> 00:32:48,039
how to act fierce around us.

393
00:32:48,039 --> 00:32:50,160
The moment you see your wife,
you turn into a coward.

394
00:32:53,920 --> 00:32:54,559
Jinqi,

395
00:32:54,960 --> 00:32:57,000
you're in for a rough night.

396
00:33:02,000 --> 00:33:03,599
Bitterness first, and sweetness later.

397
00:33:04,056 --> 00:33:05,400
After hardship comes happiness.

398
00:33:05,992 --> 00:33:08,216
Then let's drink to bitterness first,
sweetness later,

399
00:33:08,248 --> 00:33:09,450
and happiness after hardship.

400
00:33:09,480 --> 00:33:09,960
All right.

401
00:33:10,519 --> 00:33:11,200
Everyone,

402
00:33:11,519 --> 00:33:13,799
let's raise a toast
to the groom together.

403
00:33:14,079 --> 00:33:15,440
- Good!
- Good!

404
00:33:15,464 --> 00:33:17,496
- Bitterness first, sweetness later.
- Bitterness first, sweetness later.

405
00:33:17,500 --> 00:33:20,200
- After hardship comes happiness.
- After hardship comes happiness.

406
00:33:55,680 --> 00:33:56,519
Young Madam,

407
00:33:56,960 --> 00:33:59,759
it's really not proper to spend
your wedding night in the side chamber.

408
00:34:00,040 --> 00:34:01,590
You should return to the bedroom.

409
00:34:06,079 --> 00:34:07,200
You both saw

410
00:34:07,200 --> 00:34:08,360
what I did earlier.

411
00:34:09,096 --> 00:34:11,496
It would be even less appropriate
for me to stay there.

412
00:34:17,039 --> 00:34:18,320
I was scared to death.

413
00:34:18,360 --> 00:34:20,664
I was afraid you and Young Master
would start fighting.

414
00:34:20,712 --> 00:34:22,840
I didn't expect
Young Master to be so good-tempered.

415
00:34:22,952 --> 00:34:24,510
He acted as though nothing had happened

416
00:34:24,510 --> 00:34:25,592
and went off to drink.

417
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:27,400
Mind your manners.

418
00:34:27,800 --> 00:34:28,679
She is Young Madam.

419
00:34:33,239 --> 00:34:34,159
Yes.

420
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:35,719
Young Madam.

421
00:34:44,039 --> 00:34:45,320
My dear Young Madam,

422
00:34:48,880 --> 00:34:50,159
just sit still.

423
00:34:53,440 --> 00:34:54,800
I know you mean well,

424
00:34:55,480 --> 00:34:57,039
but things are different now.

425
00:34:58,559 --> 00:34:59,719
If anyone sees you doing this,

426
00:35:00,039 --> 00:35:01,239
they'll get scolded.

427
00:35:19,920 --> 00:35:21,440
Are we still friends?

428
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:43,559
My dear Young Madam,

429
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:47,639
of course we are.

430
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:52,239
As long as you don't take my work

431
00:35:52,719 --> 00:35:53,480
away from me.

432
00:35:57,639 --> 00:35:59,000
To be selfish for a moment,

433
00:36:00,679 --> 00:36:03,519
I'm truly happy today.

434
00:36:04,239 --> 00:36:05,000
Back then,

435
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:07,679
I was driven out of Zhichun Hall

436
00:36:07,760 --> 00:36:09,039
and married off to a fool.

437
00:36:11,800 --> 00:36:12,519
Now,

438
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:15,920
you're the Young Madam of Zhichun Hall.

439
00:36:18,559 --> 00:36:19,519
From now on,

440
00:36:21,000 --> 00:36:23,390
I won't have to fear that
the new Young Madam will dislike me

441
00:36:23,512 --> 00:36:25,190
and drive me out of Zhichun Hall again.

442
00:37:12,008 --> 00:37:13,440
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

443
00:37:15,288 --> 00:37:16,190
You may all leave.

444
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:19,360
Let's go.

445
00:38:30,559 --> 00:38:32,159
Before you left Zhichun Hall,

446
00:38:33,528 --> 00:38:35,190
I already had feelings for you.

447
00:38:37,920 --> 00:38:38,559
I know

448
00:38:40,072 --> 00:38:41,672
you don't feel the same way about me.

449
00:38:46,400 --> 00:38:47,880
To become your husband,

450
00:38:49,672 --> 00:38:51,190
I've thought about it for a long time

451
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:53,440
and done a great deal.

452
00:38:56,280 --> 00:38:57,000
But you

453
00:38:59,000 --> 00:39:00,320
had no time to prepare

454
00:39:01,239 --> 00:39:03,000
before suddenly becoming my wife.

455
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,800
I completely understand

456
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:10,400
why you're upset and resistant.

457
00:39:12,639 --> 00:39:13,960
If I were in your place

458
00:39:15,039 --> 00:39:17,719
and someone had schemed
and manipulated me like this,

459
00:39:19,840 --> 00:39:21,519
I'd want to kill them, too.

460
00:39:38,639 --> 00:39:39,880
I'll give you time

461
00:39:41,199 --> 00:39:42,400
to accept me.

462
00:39:44,639 --> 00:39:45,639
I'll do everything I can

463
00:39:46,840 --> 00:39:48,280
to make you fall for me, too.

464
00:39:51,039 --> 00:39:51,920
But in this lifetime,

465
00:39:53,159 --> 00:39:53,679
you,

466
00:39:54,719 --> 00:39:55,639
Xu Lanxiang,

467
00:39:56,920 --> 00:39:58,039
can only be

468
00:39:59,400 --> 00:40:00,960
my wife.

469
00:40:09,639 --> 00:40:10,440
Lin Jinqi!

470
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:12,760
What are you doing?

471
00:40:14,400 --> 00:40:16,239
Put me down, Lin Jinqi!

472
00:40:20,039 --> 00:40:21,119
Lin Jinqi!

473
00:40:22,599 --> 00:40:23,559
What are you doing?

474
00:40:23,559 --> 00:40:26,700
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

475
00:40:29,320 --> 00:40:30,239
Lin Jinqi!

476
00:40:33,760 --> 00:40:34,840
Put me down!

477
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:39,840
What are you doing? Put me down!

478
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:46,719
Lin Jinqi!

479
00:40:48,072 --> 00:40:49,320
What are you trying to do?

480
00:40:53,519 --> 00:40:54,400
From this day forward,

481
00:40:55,320 --> 00:40:56,440
we are husband and wife,

482
00:40:56,728 --> 00:40:58,552
and we'll share
both fortune and hardship.

483
00:41:00,440 --> 00:41:01,039
But

484
00:41:04,088 --> 00:41:06,008
you'll enjoy the good fortune first,

485
00:41:06,599 --> 00:41:07,880
and I'll bear the hardship first.

486
00:41:09,688 --> 00:41:11,280
If it becomes more than I can bear,

487
00:41:12,648 --> 00:41:14,328
then there's nothing I can do about it.

488
00:41:17,599 --> 00:41:18,159
Tonight,

489
00:41:18,600 --> 00:41:19,760
you'll sleep in the bedroom.

490
00:41:20,296 --> 00:41:21,630
I'll sleep in the side chamber.

491
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,500
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

492
00:43:10,079 --> 00:43:11,679
A mother can't control her grown son.

493
00:43:12,960 --> 00:43:15,519
Try to look on the bright side.

494
00:43:16,639 --> 00:43:17,400
Jiugao

495
00:43:18,440 --> 00:43:20,159
just doesn't want to marry.

496
00:43:21,000 --> 00:43:21,719
At least

497
00:43:22,190 --> 00:43:24,584
he hasn't brought some
unreliable person into the family

498
00:43:24,632 --> 00:43:27,320
to stand before you every day
and make your life miserable.

499
00:43:27,719 --> 00:43:28,679
First Madam is busy,

500
00:43:30,599 --> 00:43:31,800
so I won't go in.

501
00:43:32,559 --> 00:43:33,440
I'm fine now.

502
00:43:33,960 --> 00:43:35,239
Don't let it weigh on you.

503
00:43:36,360 --> 00:43:37,079
Don't.

504
00:43:37,239 --> 00:43:38,320
Lanxiang! Lan...

505
00:43:38,320 --> 00:43:38,880
All right.

506
00:43:55,020 --> 00:43:59,140
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

507
00:44:01,980 --> 00:44:06,500
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

508
00:44:07,780 --> 00:44:11,700
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

509
00:44:12,380 --> 00:44:15,140
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

510
00:44:15,860 --> 00:44:18,180
♪Though all the world may fade♪

511
00:44:18,180 --> 00:44:21,260
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

512
00:44:22,780 --> 00:44:27,020
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

513
00:44:29,940 --> 00:44:34,100
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

514
00:44:35,900 --> 00:44:39,460
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

515
00:44:39,460 --> 00:44:43,020
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

516
00:44:43,820 --> 00:44:49,500
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

517
00:44:49,860 --> 00:44:54,180
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

518
00:44:54,540 --> 00:44:57,500
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

519
00:44:57,500 --> 00:45:01,260
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

520
00:45:01,260 --> 00:45:04,140
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

521
00:45:04,140 --> 00:45:08,220
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

522
00:45:08,220 --> 00:45:11,580
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

523
00:45:11,580 --> 00:45:15,340
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

524
00:45:15,340 --> 00:45:19,340
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

525
00:45:20,100 --> 00:45:24,260
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

526
00:45:24,260 --> 00:45:27,700
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

527
00:45:27,700 --> 00:45:31,340
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

528
00:45:31,340 --> 00:45:34,220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

529
00:45:34,220 --> 00:45:38,300
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

530
00:45:38,300 --> 00:45:41,660
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

531
00:45:41,660 --> 00:45:45,300
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

532
00:45:45,300 --> 00:45:53,100
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
